<td>
<p>The graduate certificate in supply chain analytics equips students with descriptive, predictive and prescriptive analytical skills and provides an extensive conceptual and applied engineering background to model and solve complex supply chain management and analytics problems.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<h3 class="heading4">Learn how supply chain analytics is the right fit for you.</h3>
<p><a class="button button--accent" href="mailto:deepak.gupta@wichita.edu?subject=Supply%20Chain%20Analytics%20graduate%20certificate%20page%20inquiry">Contact coordinator</a></p>
