<section class="teaser-collection section-wrap collection--two-columns">
<div class="collection__items">
<div class="teaser collection__item ">
<div class="teaser__body">
<div class="teaser__headline">
<h3 class="headline-group "><span class="head">Curriculum</span></h3>
</div>
<div class="teaser__editorial">
<p>The certificate consists of 12 credit hours of coursework. Students will take required courses in supply chain management and analytics and two additional courses of their choice.</p>
<p>Students in the <a href="{{f:22200830}}">Master of Science in Industrial Engineering</a> and <a href="{{f:22200677}}">Master of Engineering Management</a> programs are able to use the courses in this certificate as part of their degree.</p>
</div>
<div class="teaser__links"><a class=" link--rich" href="http://catalog.wichita.edu/graduate/engineering/industrial-manufacturing-engineering/certificate-supply-chain-analytics/#requirementstext"> <span>View the curriculum</span> </a></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="teaser collection__item ">
<div class="teaser__body">
<div class="teaser__headline">
<h3 class="headline-group "><span class="head">Admission to the program</span></h3>
</div>
<div class="teaser__editorial">
<p>There are two paths to admission to the program:</p>
<ul>
<li>For those already enrolled in graduate school, simply complete the <a href="{{f:25419877}}">Declaration of Intent to Pursue a Certificate Form</a>.</li>
<li>Prospective students should apply using the Graduate School application for admission.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="teaser__links"><a class=" link--rich" href="{{f:22379639}}"> <span>Graduate School Application</span></a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section></ouc:div>


